```js
const cart = [];          // binding locked to this array
cart.push("book");        // ✓ mutates the object
// cart = [];             // ✗ TypeError: reassignment

let total = 0;            // will be reassigned
for (const price of [100, 250]) {
  total += price;         // ✓ let can be reassigned
}

if (true) {
  const message = "inside";
}
// console.log(message);  // ✗ ReferenceError: not defined outside the block
```

| Keyword | Reassign? | Scope | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| `const`. | no. | block. | default choice. |
| `let`. | yes. | block. | counters, accumulators. |
| `var`. | yes. | function (ignores blocks). | avoid in new code. |

